sequenceDiagram
    actor L as Learner
    participant App as Mobile App (UI)
    participant LDB as Local DB (WatermelonDB + outbox)
    participant SM as Sync Engine
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Supabase (PostgreSQL)
    Note over App,LDB: Device is offline
    L->>App: Complete Daily Challenge / Lesson / Listening exercise
    App->>LDB: Update local data + insert outbox record (client-generated id) in one transaction
    LDB-->>App: Saved locally, provisional Stars shown as "syncing"
    Note over LDB,DB: Network connection restored (or app foreground / every 5 minutes)
    SM->>SM: Detect connectivity change
    SM->>LDB: Read pending outbox records
    LDB-->>SM: Batch of 20-50 records
    SM->>API: POST /sync/push {device_id, records[]}
    API->>API: Recompute Stars/streak/SM-2/Final-Test outcomes from raw answers (BR-23, anti-fraud)
    API->>DB: Persist records (unique client ids make retries idempotent)
    DB-->>API: Stored
    API-->>SM: 200 OK {results[id, status], canonical Stars/streak}
    alt status = accepted or duplicate
        SM->>LDB: Delete record from outbox (BR-13), overwrite provisional values
    else status = rejected
        SM->>LDB: Keep record, store error code for display
    end
    SM->>API: GET /sync/pull?last_pulled_at=...
    API->>DB: Read changes since last pull
    API-->>SM: changes{created, updated, deleted} + new timestamp
    SM->>LDB: Apply changes (content, SM-2 state)
    LDB-->>App: Observables emit, screens refresh
    App-->>L: Show "All progress synced" indicator
